                                "sense_id": "e8a48258-67e7-3dbf-8b62-891657da1391",
                                "text": "The footage of the first Christopher Street demonstration parade came from Lilli Vencenz. She made a film called Gay and Proud and sent me a release on her footage so that I could recut it for GAY USA."
